    apply: "Read Genesis 3 and note each step of the temptation. Where have you doubted God's goodness lately? Confess it and thank him for his generous provision. When tempted this week, say, What has God said? Memorise Romans 5:19.",
    activity: "Read Genesis 3:1-13 with different learners taking the parts of narrator, serpent, woman, man and God. List the tactics and responses. Discuss how the pattern appears today. Pray, thanking God for Christ the last Adam.",
    takeHome: "Read Genesis 2-3, Romans 5:12-21, 1 Corinthians 15:20-28 and 2 Corinthians 11:1-4. Write the steps of Genesis 3 and how Christ answers them. Memorise Romans 5:19.",
    prayer: "Thank God for his generous provision. Thank Christ for obeying where we fail. Ask for faith in his word when tempted to doubt.",
